[I] Interactive TLS-capable intercepting HTTP proxy

[T] mitmproxy is an interactive, SSL/TLS-capable intercepting proxy with a
[T] console interface for HTTP/1, HTTP/2 and WebSockets. It also provides
[T] mitmdump, a command-line version, and mitmweb, a web-based interface.

[U] https://mitmproxy.org/

[A] Mitmproxy Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

